          "negativeMarks": -1,
          "correctAnswer": 1,
          "text": "Four particles $A,B,C,D$ of mass $\\frac m2,\\ m,\\ 2m,\\ 4m$, have same momentum, respectively. The particle with maximum kinetic energy is :",
