          "text": "An element $\\Delta l=\\Delta x\\,\\hat i$ is placed at the origin and carries a large current $I=10\\ \\text{A}$. The magnetic field on the $y$-axis at a distance of $0.5\\ \\text{m}$ from the elements $\\Delta x$ of $1\\ \\text{cm}$ length is:<div style='margin:10px 0;'><img src='data:image/png;base64,' alt='figure' style='max-width:320px;height:auto;'></div>",
