          "marks": 4,
          "negativeMarks": -1,
          "correctAnswer": 2,
          "text": "While measuring diameter of wire using screw gauge the following readings were noted. Main scale reading is $1\\ \\text{mm}$ and circular scale reading is equal to $42$ divisions. Pitch of screw gauge is $1\\ \\text{mm}$ and it has $100$ divisions on circular scale. The diameter of the wire is $\\frac x{50}\\ \\text{mm}$. The value of $x$ is :",
