          "text": "<div class='section-instruction'><h3>SECTION - A: MATHEMATICS (Maximum Marks: 80)</h3><ul><li>This section contains <b>20 multiple choice questions</b>. Each question has four options (1), (2), (3) and (4), out of which <b>only one</b> is correct.</li></ul><div class='marking-box'>Correct answer: +4 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Incorrect answer: &minus;1 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Unattempted: 0</div></div>Let $\\alpha,\\beta$ be the distinct roots of the equation $x^2-(t^2-5t+6)x+1=0$, $t\\in\\mathbb R$ and $a_n=\\alpha^n+\\beta^n$. Then the minimum value of $\\frac{a_{2023}+a_{2025}}{a_{2024}}$ is",
